307   81BA              ; Fill 1 MiB with a repeating RGB/index-friendly byte pattern.
308   81BA              ; All 64 banks are written so the test covers the full VRAM aperture.
309   81BA              FillModeVRAM:
310   81BA AF                   XOR     A
311   81BB 32 1C 82             LD      (CurrentBank),A
312   81BE              ModeFillBank:
